<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Summary of Training Datasets for SMT Models. Data size refers to the actual amount used for training, as we removed some overly long samples. <math id="A1.T9.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math> indicates that we performed data cleaning on the dataset. Since there is an overlap between the FLEURS and FLORES datasets, we removed the overlapping portions from the FLEURS training set. </figcaption>
